    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "Let $ABC$ be an equilateral triangle and $K$, $L$ be interior points of the side $BC$ with $|BK|=|KL|=|LC|$. What is the ratio of the diameters of the circumcircles of the triangles $AKL$ and $ABC$?",
    "image": null,
    "choices": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "2:3"
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "7:9"
